OL,3,GNEWSAWhere are the major Remembrance
OL,4,ASunday parades in Essex?
OL,5,
OL,6,FParades are due to take place in
OL,7,FEssex's three cities to mark
OL,8,FRemembrance Sunday.
OL,10,FRoad closures are planned in
OL,11,FColchester, Southend-on-Sea and
OL,12,FChelmsford as people gather to watch
OL,13,Fthe proceedings.
OL,15,FHere are the major events taking place
OL,16,Facross Essex today.
OL,18,FThe war memorial at the bottom of
OL,19,FColchester's High Street will be the
OL,20,Ffocal point for commemorations in the
OL,21,Fcity.
